      "description": "<p>The giant frilled lizard Strides. If it ends that Stride adjacent to at least one other creature, it suddenly displays its colorful neck frills and issues a frightening hiss. Each adjacent creature must succeed at a DC 21 Will Saving Throw save or become Frightened 2 (or Frightened 3 on a critical failure).</p>\n<p>The creature is then temporarily immune to Intimidating Display for 1 minute.</p>",
